							Ok, so wtf, i get so pissed at most of the morons in beta.  Just in general, cuz, really...alot of them are tools (especially horde).  but this really pisses me off:<br><br>Paladins as tanks:  equal to warriors or not?  that is to say should they be?  cuz if they can tank just as well...then they are overbalanced cuz they can heal.  well shit.  i don't think so.  Pallies can use 6 weps: 1hb,2hb,1hs,2hs,1ha,2ha.  no range attack either btw.  Ok, so warriors in addition can learn everything else (including dw).  Plus, they have some suhweet dps abilities...as far as i know.  I'm not a warrior expert, but that's what i think i know. <br><br>well shit...some of these fux wanna 'balance' pallies by nerfing them to mail... WTF??!  shamans wear mail.  To me it's like...if you had a pally and a war in a group...AND pallys have their talants and the ability to maintain agro.  Wouldn't you rather have a pally tanking and a warrior using his dps abilities that are being wasted when the war's tanking?  cuz u sure as shit aren't gonna see pallys equaling wars in the dps area on non-undeads.<br><br>to me: a warrior is a combat EXPERT.  a badass mofo who can kick your shit or take the hits.  now...picture the paladin, not the EQ paladin, but your idea of 'a paladin.'  Should he/she be any less effective at sticking in there and defending?<br><br>what u guys think?  remember it's not eq.

